entries[1223099] = { ["name"] = "Tranquility Bloom", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nThe environmental factors and changes of Quel'Thalas and the surrounding regions has had a profound impact on the local flora, including even the humble Peacebloom. It is still a staple of local crafting and is utilized in a wide variety of recipes, and a recent strain that has adapted to those changes has been dubbed Tranquility Bloom.\nDiscovery:\nMidnight Gathering Nodes" }
